            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.28.16+NUM.28.17+NUM.28.18+NUM.28.19+NUM.28.20+NUM.28.21+NUM.28.22+NUM.28.23+NUM.28.24+NUM.28.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hen 28.16-25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jia Abibu qaabad'a, jila Pasaka jed'ani AABBO Waaqa keesani tolcha; wonti akanatiifi halkani toko, jia suni keesa, inni lafa Misiri keesaa isani baase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fulla AABBO Waaqi aka isa iti kad'attani fohate d'aqa, loonifi ree teesani toko jila Pasakati qala, aka akasiini AABBO Waaqa guddiftani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hojja sagale jila suni nyaattani, qit'a bukho qabu inyaatina. Haga guyya torba qit'a bukho inqamne nyaad'a akuma gaafa lafa Misiri keesaa baqatani tolchitani. Qit'a kana, ka qit'a gaargala jed'ani, nyaad'a, aka isani haga jirtani guyya lafa Misiri, ta isani keesati gaargaltani, keesaa baatani qaabattani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haga guyya torba, mana keesani keesa, nama tokole bukho irati inargini, ammalle fooni hori halkani qara suni qalani imbulchina, halkanuma suni fit'a.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hori jila Pasaka fulla AABBO Waaqi keesani fohatu, ka isa iti kad'attaniti qala, fulla d'ibi tokoleti inqaliina. Isani duri hojja aduuni d'iite lafa Misiri keesaa baatani, tanaafi hojja aduuni d'iitu qalad'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.5+DEU.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.5",
              "DEU.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fooni suni d'aaba, fulla AABBO Waaqi keesani fohatuti nyaad'a: boriyyaate worrati dachaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haga guyya jaa qit'a bukho inqamne nyaad'a; ammalle guyya torbeeso wolwoldaa, AABBO Waaqa keesani kad'ad'a; guyya suni huji tokole inhojatina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jila gaafa mid'aani murani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
