          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.29.12+NUM.29.13+NUM.29.14+NUM.29.15+NUM.29.16+NUM.29.17+NUM.29.18+NUM.29.19+NUM.29.20+NUM.29.21+NUM.29.22+NUM.29.23+NUM.29.24+NUM.29.25+NUM.29.26+NUM.29.27+NUM.29.28+NUM.29.29+NUM.29.30+NUM.29.31+NUM.29.32+NUM.29.33+NUM.29.34+NUM.29.35+NUM.29.36+NUM.29.37+NUM.29.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hen 29.12-38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eegi isani mid'aani keesani ch'ufa d'aanatani mid'aani keesani ka zabibu ch'ufa miich'itani, jila Hoosa haga bulti torba tolfad'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jila suni keesa isanifi ilmaani teesani, hojattu teesani, worra gosa Lawiti, keessuma teesani, hiyyeeyefi nad'eeni hiyyeeyi ta dira keesani suni keesa jirtu woliini gammada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haga guyya torba fulla AABBO Waaqi keesani fohateeti jila tana tolfad'a AABBO Waaqa keesani guddisa. Gammada, waan AABBO Waaqi keesani huji teesanifi mid'aani keesanile eebiseefi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ganna keesa maro sadi nami keesani ka d'iira ha AABBO Waaqa fulla inni fohateeti dura d'ufuti: Jila Pasaka taanaani, jila gaafa mid'aani murani taanaani, ammalle jila Hoosa taanaani, worri d'iira suni tokoleeni harka duwa ind'ufini; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ammo nami ch'ufti, haga dandau, waan AABBO Waaqi isaa kenne gula, ha wo baasuti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka dubbi d'uga gula qorani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dira AABBO Waaqi keesani isani kenne ch'ufa keesati, jaallabafi jaarole dubbi qortu tolfad'a. Worri kunini ha d'uga gula dubbi qore muruti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.23.6+EXO.23.7+EXO.23.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bah 23.6-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.19.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Law 19.15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri d'ara gula dubbi qore, yokhaani nama ira inch'iisini. Ammalle gumbole inyaatini, wonti akanatiifi, gumbooni ila nama qalbi qabule duuchite, nama d'ugale kiyyibsifti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan d'ibi lakisa, d'uga ch'alla gula deema, aka lafa AABBO Waaqi keesani isanii kennu fud'attani iti qubattani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
